<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>2.1.2: Self Check</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m00371</md:content-id>
    <md:title>2.1.2: Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>a27e0395-e984-4b08-8ff8-d1faab6890c0</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para dir="ltr">A school group bought 12 tickets to visit a history museum. </para>
<list>
  <item>Adult tickets are $5 each.</item>
  <item>Student tickets are $8 each.</item>
</list>
<para dir="ltr">The school paid a total of $90. How many adult tickets, \(x\), and student tickets, \(y\), did the school buy?</para></section>
</content>
</document>
